<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Albany ups Davox.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Albany ups Davox.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Albany Corp said analyst Herbert Tinger upgraded Davox Corp to strong buy from buy, citing &quot;blowout&quot; first quarter results.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 earnings per share estimate to $1.74 from $1.49 and 1998 estimate to $1.80 from $1.43.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at 37-3/4.</p>
</text>
